------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This package is an unofficial port to ComfyUI of the Deforum animation engine.
The ported code comes ONLY from versions released under the MIT License:
- the Deforum extension for AUTOMATIC1111 (github.com/deforum-art/sd-webui-deforum)
  as of commit a7b829e (2023-08-10), the last commit before its relicensing;
- the Deforum Stable Diffusion notebook (github.com/deforum-art/deforum-stable-diffusion).
Their notices, and those of the third-party code they include, follow.
